---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<!-- TODO(confirm): have counsel review this policy before launch. -->
<SiteLayout title="Privacy">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" lede="How we handle the information you share with us." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit a form, we collect the details you enter, such as your name, email, phone number, plan or business
        name, and the specifics of your request. Portal clients also store documents and messages in their private portal.
      </p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information only to respond to your requests, provide the services in your agreement, and keep your
        plan records. We do not sell your information.
      </p>
      <h2>How we protect it</h2>
      <p>
        The site and portal are served over encrypted connections. Portal documents are stored privately and are only
        available to you and the team after sign-in. Passwords are stored as one-way hashes.
      </p>
      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We share information with outside professionals, such as attorneys or CPAs, only when needed for work you have
        agreed to, or when required by law.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use a single essential cookie to keep you signed in to the portal. We do not use advertising cookies.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about your information? Call {site.phone} or <a href="/forms/contact-team">send us a message</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
